 drivers/platform/x86/Kconfig      | 11 ++++
 drivers/platform/x86/Makefile     |  3 +
 drivers/platform/x86/getac-mpmd.c | 96 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 116 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/platform/x86/getac-mpmd.c

